{"id":"empresa","lemma":"empresa","pos":"noun","rank":947,"glosses":["company","enterprise, undertaking","task"],"ipa":"/emˈpɾesa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"empresas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-empresa.wav","formAudio":{"empresas":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cc/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-empresas.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Mi empresa tiene éxito.","en":"My company is successful.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/599077"},{"text":"Muchas empresas hacen publicidad en televisión de sus productos.","en":"Many companies advertise their products on TV.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/764900"},{"text":"Yo trabajo en esta empresa.","en":"I work at this company.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/458574"},{"text":"Las dos empresas planean fusionarse.","en":"The two companies plan to unite."},{"text":"Él ha fundado una empresa recientemente.","en":"He set up a company recently.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/706923"}]}